  "correction_rules": [
    "Adjust forecasts downward when sentiment history includes positive values (0.33 or above) indicating bullish bias.",
    "Reduce forecast overshoots following sharp price spikes by applying a 10-15% downward correction.",
    "Apply mean reversion by averaging the last 5-7 true outcomes before the forecast horizon if model shows persistent overestimation.",
    "Increase forecast sensitivity to recent low prices when sentiment is negative (e.g., -0.25) to avoid prolonged overvaluation.",
    "Shift forecast horizon downward by 1-2 days if true outcomes consistently lag behind model predictions by more than 3 days."
